|---|---|---|---|
| ECharts (`echarts-6.1.0.min.js`) | 6.1.0 | Apache-2.0 | `web/vendor/ECHARTS-LICENSE` |
| marked (`marked-18.1.1.umd.js`) | 18.1.1 | MIT | `web/vendor/MARKED-LICENSE` |
| DOMPurify (`purify-3.4.17.min.js`) | 3.4.17 | Apache-2.0 OR MPL-2.0 | `web/vendor/DOMPURIFY-LICENSE` |

The full text of each license is included in the referenced file under `web/vendor/`.

Node.js build-time dependencies for the CDK app (`infra/`) and any Python
dependencies installed at build time are not redistributed in this repository;
their licenses remain with their respective upstream projects and are resolved
from the pinned manifests (`infra/package-lock.json` and the packaged Python
requirements).
